# Configuration passed to the app with `--dart-define-from-file=.env`
# (`make setup` copies this file to `.env` when it does not exist yet).
# Values are compiled into the build, so keep secrets out of this file.
#
# SQLite database file opened by the local drift database.
# Not honoured yet: the app opens the database in the platform's app-data
# directory, which is the only writable place on a phone. A relative path
# would resolve against the process directory, which Android does not let
# the app write to, so this stays empty until the container/desktop
# deployment described in STACK.md needs it.
DATABASE_PATH=
